# `sort` with nothing after it: DS0121 with an example, no fix.
mode: syntax
---- query
from 'orders.csv' | sort
---- expected
PROGRAM@0..25
  PIPELINE@0..24
    IDENT@0..4 "from"
    WHITESPACE@4..5 " "
